    "created_at": "2021-11-18T03:35:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-18T03:35:27Z",
    "body": "I'm happy to file implementation bugs and work on the tests, but before that, I'd like to know whether that's a change that Chrome and Firefox (others?) would be willing to make. (I would also be happy to work on upstreaming the Brave changes to Chromium.)\r\n\r\nIs @mikewest 's suggestion (only touching `no-cors`) what folks think should be done? Is this something I should bring up at the next WebAppSec teleconf?",
